<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page exercise-page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="eyebrow">MOVE IN YOUR OWN WAY</view><view class="heading">动一动，也值得记下来</view><view class="subtitle">选一项运动，填写分钟数，估算这次的额外消耗。</view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="2000-01-01" end="{{today}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="exercise-date card"><view><view class="title">运动日期</view><view class="caption">一天可多次记录不同运动</view></view><text class="exercise-date-value">{{date}} ⌄</text></view></picker><view class="card manual-exercise-card"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">今日做了什么运动</text><input class="input" value="{{manualName}}" data-key="manualName" bindinput="manualInput" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：饭后散步、拉伸、跳舞"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">运动时长 / 分钟</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{manualMinutes}}" data-key="manualMinutes" bindinput="manualInput" placeholder="填写运动分钟数"/></view><button class="btn" bindtap="saveManual" disabled="{{busy || !manualName || !manualMinutes}}">保存这次运动</button><view class="form-hint">自由填写的运动仅记录时长；需估算消耗，可从下方选择对应运动。</view></view><view class="exercise-search"><image class="search-icon" src="/images/ui/search.svg"/><input class="exercise-query" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索运动，如：快走、羽毛球"/></view><view class="section-title mt">常见运动</view><view class="caption">下方为当前体重估算的每60分钟消耗</view><view class="exercise-list"><button wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" class="exercise-option" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose"><view class="exercise-symbol"><image class="exercise-icon" src="/images/ui/{{item.icon}}.svg"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="exercise-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="exercise-caption">{{item.kcal}} 千卡 / 60 分钟 · {{item.category}}</view></view><text class="exercise-plus">＋</text></button><view wx:if="{{!shown.length}}" class="empty">没有找到对应运动，换个关键词试试。</view><button wx:if="{{!query}}" class="exercise-more" bindtap="more">{{expanded?'收起更多运动':'查看更多运动'}}</button></view><view class="notice mt">按 {{weight}} kg（{{weightSource}}）估算；运动强度与个体差异会影响实际消耗。当前为本地估算示例。</view><view class="section-head section"><text class="section-title">这天的运动</text><text class="small-text">{{sessions.length}} 次 · {{totalMinutes}} 分钟</text></view><view class="card"><view wx:if="{{!sessions.length}}" class="empty">还没有运动记录，按自己的节奏开始就好。</view><view class="record-row" wx:for="{{sessions}}" wx:key="id"><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="caption">{{item.minutes}} 分钟 · {{item.exerciseKcal ? item.exerciseKcal + ' 千卡' : '消耗未估算'}}</view></view><button class="delete" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view><view class="exercise-disclaimer">消耗值为估算，不能作为强迫进食或过度运动的依据。</view><view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="exercise-sheet"><view class="title">{{selected.name}}</view><view class="caption">运动时长 / 分钟</view><input class="input mt" type="digit" value="{{minutes}}" bindinput="duration" placeholder="填写运动分钟数"/><view class="footer-buttons mt"><button class="btn soft" bindtap="cancel">取消</button><button class="btn" bindtap="add" disabled="{{busy}}">记下这次运动</button></view></view></view><view class="exercise-footer"><text>已估算消耗 <text class="exercise-total">{{totalKcal}}</text> 千卡</text><button class="exercise-done" bindtap="done">完成</button></view>